BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kessel-run-ultra-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART:20261107T060000Z
DTEND:20261107T100000Z
SUMMARY:Kessel Run Ultra
DESCRIPTION:Trail ultramarathon event located in North Fruita Desert\, Colorado featuring world-class single track trails with sweeping views of the San Juan Mountains and Colorado National Monument. All distances begin on fast\, flowing singletrack and progress to steep terrain on the Zippity-Do-Da Trail. Course elevations range from 5\,030' to 5\,541'. Event includes aid stations\, finisher's medal\, custom race shirt\, bib\, and BOCO Technical Trucker hat.
LOCATION:18 Road Parking\, Fruita\, CO (GPS: 39.31093\, -108.70360)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:longmont-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont Turkey Trot features one of the fastest\, most scenic 10K and 2-mile courses in the area. Participants can run\, roll\, or participate in the wheelchair division for the 10K race. Packet pick-up is Friday\, November 13\, 4pm-6pm at the Longmont Recreation Center. Registration closes Thursday\, November 12 at 12pm\, with late registration available November 13 and race morning. Awards given to 1st\, 2nd\, and 3rd place winners in multiple age and gender categories.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, 4600 Clover Basin Dr\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
