BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mile-high-united-way-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Mile High United Way Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The 53rd Mile High United Way Turkey Trot is Denver's greatest Thanksgiving Day tradition held at Washington Park. Participants can walk or run a 4-mile course (or 1-mile Lil' Gobbler Family Fun Run). The race supports Mile High United Way's mission to provide families with early learning\, education\, housing support\, and basic needs assistance. Features include multiple start waves\, a Lil' Gobbler Family Fun Zone with games and activities\, and serves as a qualifier race for the BOLDERBoulder 10K.
LOCATION:1700 E. Louisiana Ave.\, Denver\, CO 80210
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:turkey-rock-trot-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey ROCK Trot 5k
DESCRIPTION:Plum Creek Church 22nd Annual Turkey ROCK Trot Presented by CORE. A Thanksgiving morning 5K family fun run/walk/stroll featuring a live DJ\, live music on course\, indoor health & wellness expo with 30+ vendors\, free food items\, face painting\, balloon twisting\, and bounce house. All proceeds benefit The Help&Hope Center. Features wave corrals\, multiple award categories\, and a costume contest.
LOCATION:Douglas County Event Center\, 500 Fairgrounds Drive\, Castle Rock\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:colderboulder-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T080000Z
DTEND:20261205T120000Z
SUMMARY:COLDERBoulder
DESCRIPTION:COLDERBoulder 5K winter race featuring 13 invitational races organized by pace\, 1 open race\, and 1 walking wave. All participants receive medals\, with special Cold Medals awarded to top 3 finishers in each invitational race. Includes Holiday Finish Fest with burritos\, doughnuts\, coffee\, and hot cocoa. Virtual registration available. Event sells out annually; public registration opens October 1st\, 2026.
LOCATION:CU Campus\, Boulder\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
